      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "In the previous section, we defined the model for lethal equivalents in terms of partially recessive deleterious alleles. The same logic can be used to redefine the model in terms of overdominant gene action. This approach again gives rise to Equation 10.19, but with the definitions of A and B altered to",
